- [ ] "Get Pro — $29/mo" opens the Stripe Payment Link in a new tab.
- [ ] Stripe checkout page loads cleanly (not a 404 or broken link).

**Design System Compliance**
- [ ] No shadows anywhere in the new sections (`box-shadow: none`; check DevTools).
- [ ] No border-radius on tier columns or buttons.
- [ ] No new fonts in the Network tab that weren't loaded by the baseline page.

**Performance**
- [ ] Run Lighthouse (Chrome DevTools → Lighthouse tab → Performance) on the deployed page.
- [ ] Performance score does not regress from the baseline. Record both scores.
  - Baseline: `___` (measure before this PR merges)
  - After: `___`
- [ ] No new render-blocking resources in the Lighthouse waterfall.

