## Explicitly Out of Scope

| Item | Reason |
|------|--------|
| In-page signup / login form | Auth lives in the Specview app |
| Stripe.js / Stripe Elements | Stripe-hosted checkout owns PCI scope |
| Annual pricing toggle | Monthly only for v1 |
| Team / Enterprise tier | Revisit on inbound enterprise interest |
| Logged-in state detection | Requires JS + Specview API call on every load — kills static posture |
| Usage dashboard / project-counter UI | Belongs in the Specview app |
| A/B testing infrastructure | Ship one version first |
| Analytics pixels | Out of scope for this epic |
| New CSS files or additional font `<link>` tags | Would regress Lighthouse; all tokens already loaded |
| CTA component system / `data-*` registry | P4 — two anchors don't justify abstraction |

